{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-19567","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20057","text":"Dual- and Triple-Loop Machine Architecture"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-19569","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20058","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE update (OS-010, 2026-04):"},{"id":"spn-20059","text":" With the introduction of OS-010 PULSE, the loop-interlock pattern documented here is now formalized as a manifest standard. Graphonomous, PRISM, AgenTroMatic, and every other portfolio loop declare their phases in "},{"id":"spn-20060","marks":["code"],"text":"<loop>.pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-20061","text":" files (see "},{"id":"spn-20062","marks":["code"],"text":"/PULSE/manifests/"},{"id":"spn-20063","text":"), validated against "},{"id":"spn-20064","marks":["code"],"text":"pulse-loop-manifest.v0.1.json"},{"id":"spn-20065","text":". The \"dual loop\" is a special case of arbitrarily nestable PULSE loops — the same machine grouping works at any depth, and PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-20066","marks":["code"],"text":"interact"},{"id":"spn-20067","text":" phase reads the inner system's PULSE manifest to discover the "},{"id":"spn-20068","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-20069","text":" boundary at runtime rather than hard-coding the integration. See \"Triple loop and beyond\" below."}]}],"id":"blk-19568","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-19570","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20070","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-19571","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20071","text":"PRISM and Graphonomous are both closed-loop systems. When PRISM evaluates Graphonomous, their loops interlock — the outer loop (PRISM) improves the benchmark while the inner loop (Graphonomous) improves the memory. Each makes the other sharper."}]},{"id":"blk-19572","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20072","text":"The machine architecture solves the tool explosion problem: 47 PRISM tools + 29 Graphonomous tools = 76 tools in a shared session. Research shows tool selection accuracy degrades to ~49% at that scale, and schema overhead burns 40-80K tokens."}]},{"id":"blk-19573","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20073","marks":["bold"],"text":"Solution:"},{"id":"spn-20074","text":" Group tools by loop phase, not category. 6 PRISM machines + 5 Graphonomous machines = 11 tools. Selection accuracy jumps to ~95%."}]},{"id":"blk-19574","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20075","text":"The Interlocking Loops"}]},{"id":"blk-19575","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Graphonomous (memory loop)          PRISM (evaluation loop)\n──────────────────────────          ───────────────────────\nretrieve  \"What do I know?\"         compose    \"What should I test?\"\nroute     \"What should I do?\"       interact   \"Run the test\"\nact       \"Do it\"                   observe    \"Judge the result\"\nlearn     \"Did it work?\"            reflect    \"What should change?\"\nconsolidate \"Clean up\"              diagnose   \"What's actionable?\""},{"id":"blk-19576","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20076","text":"When PRISM benchmarks Graphonomous:"}]},{"id":"blk-19577","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"PRISM compose ──→ PRISM interact ──→ PRISM observe ──→ PRISM reflect ──→ PRISM diagnose\n                       │\n                       ▼\n              ┌─── Graphonomous ───┐\n              │  retrieve → route  │\n              │  → act → learn     │\n              │  → consolidate     │\n              └────────────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-19578","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20077","text":"PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-20078","marks":["code"],"text":"interact"},{"id":"spn-20079","text":" phase drives the system-under-test through its own closed loop. PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-20080","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-20081","text":" phase judges how well that inner loop performed. PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-20082","marks":["code"],"text":"reflect"},{"id":"spn-20083","text":" phase evolves scenarios based on where the inner loop failed."}]},{"id":"blk-19579","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20084","text":"PRISM: 47 tools → 6 machines"}]},{"id":"blk-19580","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20085","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-20086","text":" — \"What should I test?\" (9 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-19581","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20087","marks":["code"],"text":"scenarios"},{"id":"spn-20088","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20089","marks":["code"],"text":"validate"},{"id":"spn-20090","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20091","marks":["code"],"text":"list"},{"id":"spn-20092","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20093","marks":["code"],"text":"get"},{"id":"spn-20094","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20095","marks":["code"],"text":"retire"},{"id":"spn-20096","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20097","marks":["code"],"text":"import"},{"id":"spn-20098","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20099","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_register"},{"id":"spn-20100","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20101","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_discover"},{"id":"spn-20102","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20103","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_generate"}]},{"id":"blk-19582","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20104","marks":["code"],"text":"interact"},{"id":"spn-20105","text":" — \"Run the test\" (8 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-19583","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20106","marks":["code"],"text":"run"},{"id":"spn-20107","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20108","marks":["code"],"text":"run_sequence"},{"id":"spn-20109","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20110","marks":["code"],"text":"run_matrix"},{"id":"spn-20111","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20112","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-20113","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20114","marks":["code"],"text":"transcript"},{"id":"spn-20115","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20116","marks":["code"],"text":"cancel"},{"id":"spn-20117","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20118","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_evaluate"},{"id":"spn-20119","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20120","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_compare"}]},{"id":"blk-19584","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20121","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-20122","text":" — \"Judge the result\" (5 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-19585","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20123","marks":["code"],"text":"judge_transcript"},{"id":"spn-20124","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20125","marks":["code"],"text":"judge_dimension"},{"id":"spn-20126","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20127","marks":["code"],"text":"meta_judge"},{"id":"spn-20128","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20129","marks":["code"],"text":"meta_judge_batch"},{"id":"spn-20130","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20131","marks":["code"],"text":"override"}]},{"id":"blk-19586","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20132","marks":["code"],"text":"reflect"},{"id":"spn-20133","text":" — \"What should change?\" (7 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-19587","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20134","marks":["code"],"text":"analyze_gaps"},{"id":"spn-20135","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20136","marks":["code"],"text":"evolve"},{"id":"spn-20137","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20138","marks":["code"],"text":"advance_cycle"},{"id":"spn-20139","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20140","marks":["code"],"text":"calibrate_irt"},{"id":"spn-20141","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20142","marks":["code"],"text":"cycle_history"},{"id":"spn-20143","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20144","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_recommend"},{"id":"spn-20145","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20146","marks":["code"],"text":"byor_infer_profile"}]},{"id":"blk-19588","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20147","marks":["code"],"text":"diagnose"},{"id":"spn-20148","text":" — \"What's actionable?\" (13 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-19589","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20149","marks":["code"],"text":"report"},{"id":"spn-20150","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20151","marks":["code"],"text":"failure_patterns"},{"id":"spn-20152","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20153","marks":["code"],"text":"retest"},{"id":"spn-20154","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20155","marks":["code"],"text":"verify"},{"id":"spn-20156","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20157","marks":["code"],"text":"regressions"},{"id":"spn-20158","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20159","marks":["code"],"text":"suggest_fixes"},{"id":"spn-20160","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20161","marks":["code"],"text":"leaderboard"},{"id":"spn-20162","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20163","marks":["code"],"text":"leaderboard_history"},{"id":"spn-20164","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20165","marks":["code"],"text":"compare_systems"},{"id":"spn-20166","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20167","marks":["code"],"text":"dimension_leaders"},{"id":"spn-20168","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20169","marks":["code"],"text":"fit_recommendation"},{"id":"spn-20170","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20171","marks":["code"],"text":"compare_fit"},{"id":"spn-20172","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20173","marks":["code"],"text":"task_profiles"}]},{"id":"blk-19590","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20174","marks":["code"],"text":"config"},{"id":"spn-20175","text":" — Admin/setup (5 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-19591","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20176","marks":["code"],"text":"set_weights"},{"id":"spn-20177","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20178","marks":["code"],"text":"register_system"},{"id":"spn-20179","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20180","marks":["code"],"text":"list_systems"},{"id":"spn-20181","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20182","marks":["code"],"text":"get_config"},{"id":"spn-20183","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20184","marks":["code"],"text":"create_profile"}]},{"id":"blk-19592","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20185","text":"Graphonomous: 29 tools → 5 machines"}]},{"id":"blk-19593","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20186","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-20187","text":" — \"What do I know?\" (6 actions)"}]},{"id":"blk-19594","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20188","marks":["code"],"text":"context"},{"id":"spn-20189","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20190","marks":["code"],"text":"episodic"},{"id":"spn-20191","text":", "},{"id":"spn-20192","marks":["code"],"text":"procedural"},{"id":"spn-20193","